WEBVTT

00:00:06.179 --> 00:00:09.998
Settings → Sources: connect Garmin, Strava, Withings, intervals.icu or a calendar.

00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:13.197
Garmin: sign in with your Garmin account and choose 'Connect Garmin'.

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:16.365
'Update now' fetches the latest data right away.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:21.182
The mark in front of the name shows on your watch which workouts come from VibeSynergy.

00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:24.949
Or choose a mark per workout type; the defaults are filled in.

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:32.659
Multisport gets the marks of its sports, or one mark of its own.

00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:37.958
intervals.icu gets a copy of your plan. Here you see the last copy and what was copied; your messages only list real plan changes.

00:00:38.008 --> 00:00:42.667
Older data? Import the export zip from Garmin or Strava.

00:00:42.717 --> 00:00:46.860
Publishing and sync: what VibeSynergy writes out. Your workouts are VibeSynergy's; publish one and it stays the same everywhere.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:50.840
New workouts: public (published by themselves) or only me (you tick Publish yourself).

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:55.053
Publish to: Strava, Garmin or both. Each place keeps its own text, with VibeSynergy's section below it.

00:00:55.103 --> 00:01:00.510
Keep name, texts and gear the same everywhere: a published workout has the same name, public text and gear everywhere. Off by default.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:08.380
What goes in the text: language, quote, weather and the block's markers.
